      "content": "I'll read both the original test and the CUT source to understand what needs to be improved.Now I understand the test. Let me write an improved version with better names and explanatory comments, then compile it.Now I'll write the improved test with better variable names and explanatory comments.The improved test compiled successfully. The refactored version uses descriptive variable names (`nullKeyTransformer`, `backingList`, `uniqueCollection`) and adds a concise Javadoc comment explaining the test's intent — making it clear why a duplicate-key exception is expected when a null-constant transformer maps all elements to the same index key."
